{"id":"85ef9f58d72ef99a","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-predicative-elimination.md","title":"Veblen 切消界","display":"thm-predicative-elimination — Veblen 切消界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-predicative-elimination","aliases":["18-thm-predicative-elimination"],"display":"thm-predicative-elimination — Veblen 切消界","depends_on":["[[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]","[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","[[18-df-infinitary-derivability]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Lemma 7.3.14; Definition 8.3.1 (extension to NTω₁)","source_pages":"116,135","source_pdf_pages":"126,145","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-predicative-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-predicative-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-predicative-elimination — Veblen 切消界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8accc2f8cbc49eab\" href=\"?note=8accc2f8cbc49eab\" title=\"18-df-semiformal-derivability\">18-df-semiformal-derivability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"02bcc9140b83afbe\" href=\"?note=02bcc9140b83afbe\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-derivability\">18-df-infinitary-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Lemma 7.3.14; Definition 8.3.1 (extension to NTω₁)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"116,135"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"126,145"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8accc2f8cbc49eab\" href=\"?note=8accc2f8cbc49eab\" title=\"18-df-semiformal-derivability\">18-df-semiformal-derivability</a> 的关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a> 的 Veblen 函数，序数算术按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a> 及其上游。另取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in[\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Sigma\\in[\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\infty,\\eta}^{\\xi}\">\\(D_{\\infty,\\eta}^{\\xi}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"02bcc9140b83afbe\" href=\"?note=02bcc9140b83afbe\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-derivability\">18-df-infinitary-derivability</a> 的可数分支系统，其切秩按序数函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty\">\\(\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty\\)</span> 控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{\\beta+\\omega^\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_\\beta^{\\varphi_\\rho(\\alpha)}(\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{\\beta+\\omega^\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_\\beta^{\\varphi_\\rho(\\alpha)}(\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{\\infty,\\beta+\\omega^\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Sigma)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_{\\infty,\\beta}^{\\varphi_\\rho(\\alpha)}(\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{\\infty,\\beta+\\omega^\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Sigma)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_{\\infty,\\beta}^{\\varphi_\\rho(\\alpha)}(\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Lemma 7.3.14。已核对陈述、双归纳结构及关键不动点界；完整长证明未在此重写。Definition 8.3.1 明确将该节定理延伸到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NT}_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{NT}_{\\omega_1}\\)</span>；现在有了完整的分支语法、序数秩和具体带切规则，第二式给出这一原书扩展。它不把任意额外规则或任意未定义的高秩语言纳入适用范围。下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 与有限算术系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 区分，避免把有限逻辑符号总数与分支序数秩混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-semiformal-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","a